                                                "sense_id": "e4134c03-a04a-3516-8c2b-ffbef4ec1afb",
                                                "text": "Moreover, at a tab of $9 million, the system's price is about $1 million less than a conventional heating-cooling plant […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a94c3e9-ffda-3265-b556-39162e33fccd",
                                        "entry_id": "6e747df8-367b-3a02-8b88-1b9b79d1cdc1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A space character that extends to the next aligned column, traditionally used for tabulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
